<title>UK: Jardine Lloyd Thompson H1 pretax up 1.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Jardine Lloyd Thompson H1 pretax up 1.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Investment income	3.3		    vs 3.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.25		   vs 3.0</p>
<p> Operating profit	 7.3		    vs 6.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     10.6		   vs 10.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   24.7		   vs 23.1</p>
<p> Earnings per share     8.37		   vs 8.34</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said a special dividend of six pence would be paid as a foreign income dividend to shareholders who were previously shareholders of Lloyd Thompson Group. Full name of the international insurance and reinsurance broker is Jardine Lloyd Thompson Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
